//! The `dependent` reference type discipline of [TYPES-DISCIPLINE-REFERENCE]
//! and [PROOF-DISCIPLINE] (specs 0050 and 0049): a module marked
//! `// osprey: types=dependent` may state and prove theorems of the
//! dependent theory beside its ordinary code. Each `theorem` line is read by
//! the kernel's surface reader and checked by the kernel; a proof erases to
//! nothing ([PROOF-ERASE]), so the HM pipeline receives the rest of the
//! module unchanged.
//!
//! This directory is the checker project: the compiler builds it as one
//! program with `<compiler> <checker-directory> --compile`.

namespace dependent

import bounded::Checker


main () = Checker::serve Theorems::judge
